      "source": "Creates a <a href=\"../ReactiveSessionFactory.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.cassandra\"><code>ReactiveSessionFactory</code></a> to be used by the <a href=\"../core/ReactiveCassandraTemplate.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.cassandra.core\"><code>ReactiveCassandraTemplate</code></a>. Uses the\n<a href=\"../ReactiveSession.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.cassandra\"><code>ReactiveSession</code></a> instance configured in <a href=\"#reactiveCassandraSession()\"><code>reactiveCassandraSession()</code></a>.",
      "translation": "创建一个<a href=\"../ReactiveSessionFactory.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.cassandra 中的接口\"><code>ReactiveSessionFactory</code></a>，供<a href=\"../core/ReactiveCassandraTemplate.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.cassandra.core 中的类\"><code>ReactiveCassandraTemplate</code></a>使用。该工厂使用在<a href=\"#reactiveCassandraSession()\"><code>reactiveCassandraSession()</code></a>中配置的<a href=\"../ReactiveSession.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.cassandra 中的接口\"><code>ReactiveSession</code></a>实例。",
